# gazelle:default_visibility //visibility:public

# third-party/ hosts the opt-in, vendor-dependent integrations (ADR 0012), one
# Go module per vendor (ADR 0157): third-party/aws, third-party/codec/{hcl,
# protobuf,yaml}, third-party/db/writer/{clickhouse,mysql,redis},
# third-party/transform and third-party/x-crypto, each with its own go.mod and
# released in the lockstep chain. Everything here is publicly visible —
# consumers blank-import these packages to activate the matching writer, codec
# or scheme. The ssh Identity of entitlement is no longer here: it is the
# framework's connector module framework/connectors/ssh (ADR 0158).

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])
